<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-28T00:08:55.860Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:08:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a village in Plateau State, killing 17 people, while armed men killed 13 Niger soldiers in Sanam and bandits abducted nine residents in Zamfara. The Plateau governor condemned the killings and ordered stronger security, and the Niger State governor directed protection for residents after the Zamfara abductions. In addition, gunmen injured four people in an overnight attack on a Plateau community and killed 16 there, and a separate incident injured one supporter at a political gathering in Edo. The conflict remains intense, with 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNTHRIOXFBRXE1M1RqOTFHZXZkVHc2Tzh4T0lqVlVndDhLYjZDT01INE1BM1FBSWxpMFVyMkFkUFEwVHFDcnFfblBmTmdWR3FFNGRPSzU1UFV6SFdBVm9iUEJHNko5M2hLUjhvWTUweTNyTGNoZlNlZWVESk9IWTBBV1dWNVhEVUxDMW51Mi0ydUdnbEZhbmVyREJzNngwZHkwVHFEdmZzaUh3RjA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQeTdIYWEwS0NpNkc4M1NtVnduNTRhQVA0dW5JdnNxVlBVSHJaVm5iOE1RVExUSm1TY1YwV3ppQkw1OHc2M0U4cV9tVWxnYVdpUDMxUkxUdi11V0VybEZoM2tyMHFON2JBS3pvb18zU0hCLVFwSlBwQmJOTExLdVlDSm1NRENXblpocHVZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOZHItNl9WYzZ3R0t2dTF5dUVrVjdiTzdEWXphTWJCNExGX0dVaVRsMHZOUlVkb2t3TkZ4a0h0U0JtblZld19PalJRNkdsX2hReXRjTUVRQVl6VkdSUnhtTThCSFVPdjVmV2NwaUx1MU9DMTcyUFE4UGZKbUo4elhmUkUxcUJLWFdCNjhUVXkwbTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legit.ng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE9md3gxNDZXS0ZWVUxMcnd3X2dtRWwtTXdhUzhrcUNzd19lVVB5blhmSUZzbzZPVnhiS01mUjl5alhYeWlRXy1ma1hKX3V6ZXRUM0xxZ2EzSUptVExVM1hxOGx3UmRXaE1UbUNZNDNjRnB5ODh6WlFjNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legit.n